version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-10
repository-code: "https://github.com/songlab-osu/vessel_permeability"
url: "https://github.com/songlab-osu/vessel_permeability"
abstract: >-
  MATLAB code for measuring the apparent permeability (P_app) of
  cylindrical microvessels from fluorescence time-lapse images of tracer
  perfusion. The vessel lumen is segmented, background- and
  baseline-corrected tracer intensities in the lumen and surrounding
  matrix are tracked over time, and P_app is computed from the rate of
  tracer accumulation outside the vessel with a geometry factor for
  confocal or widefield imaging. Reads ImageJ/Fiji TIFFs natively and
  Nikon .nd2 and other microscope formats via Bio-Formats.
keywords:
  - MATLAB
  - permeability
  - apparent permeability
  - microvessels
  - microfluidics
  - image analysis
  - fluorescence microscopy
  - tracer diffusion
license: MIT
